==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[sympathetick]] {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌsɪmpəˈθɛtɪk/}}
* {{audio|En-us-sympathetic.ogg|Audio (US)}}
